 4 versions (stable, latest, older version)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe issue can be reproduced when the project setting `window/subwindows/embed_subwindows` = false.\nEvery time a window is added to the scene tree and removed, GDI objects are not properly removed and thus leak.\n\nA simple way of observing this is to open the task manager -> details -> add GDI objects to the colums.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ac171791-38c5-4174-8d59-884791757ce6\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Disable embed_subwindows in project settings.\n- Add a window to the scene tree\n- queue_free the window\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[gdi-leak.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24400719/gdi-leak.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114496/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114496/timeline","performed_via_g